{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50133","headline":"度大臾（庾）岭（其二伯三六一九） · 宋之问","name":"度大臾（庾）岭（其二伯三六一九）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城边问官使：「早晚发西京？来日河桥柳，春条几寸生？昆池水合渌，御苑草应青？」缓缓从头说，教人眼暂明。\n（按《度大臾岭》二首，《全唐诗》仅载「其一」，兹补「其二」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}